[Trigger]
Name	tolling
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Bellwick stands over its own dead, master. The abbey bells call the faithful to arms, and Abbot Lorens Bell keeps an undead keeper in the undercroft to bring the sleepers up.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the heart of the undead keeper in the north undercroft.
Action	objective	1	Hold the nave against the faithful.
Action	objective	1	Hold out until the two north gates of the nave are unsealed.
Action	portal	2	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	yardHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	SouthYard	40
Action	message	1	The south yard is held. The long nave begins here and the abbey knows you are at the door.
Action	reveal	1	Nave
Action	reveal	1	Refectory
Action	objective	1	Walk the nave to the transept.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	naveEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Nave
Action	message	1	Candles still burn along the nave. A row of crypt cells lies behind iron-banded doors.
Action	reveal	1	CryptRow
Action	reveal	1	WestCloister
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cryptRow
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	CryptRow
Action	message	1	Old bones in the cells will rise for whoever holds the crypt. Your gifts have come.
Action	spawn	1	14	70	1	Orc:3	Goblin:3	Spider:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	transept
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Transept
Action	message	1	The bells are tolling at both gates of the transept. The faithful are answering.
Action	reveal	1	EastCloister
Action	reveal	1	Scriptorium
Action	spawn	3	7	62	1	Knight:3	Monk:3	Elf:2	Adventurer:2
Action	spawn	3	56	62	1	Knight:3	Monk:3	Dwarf2:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	kills1
Mode	once
Cond	kills	1	>=	12
Action	message	1	The sextons are dying faster than the abbot can send them. Strengthen your creatures while the nave is quiet.
Action	gold	1	800
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	mined1
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	1500
Action	message	1	The seams below the abbey pay well. Iron doors and a stone bridge are worth the gold now.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bellTower
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	BellTower
Action	message	1	The bell tower rings the abbey awake. The undercroft is waking, too.
Action	reveal	1	Undercroft
Action	spawn	2	30	18	1	Skeleton:3	Skeleton:3	Lich:3	Cultist:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	undercroftSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Undercroft
Action	message	1	The keeper of the undercroft has spent the dead. Break his hall and the bells go quiet.
Action	spawn	2	30	18	1	Skeleton:4	Lich:3	Cultist:3	Skeleton:3
[/Trigger]
